  "goodToKnow": "Die Restauration is restoration of artworks and buildings (also Restaurierung) and, in history, the conservative era after Napoleon's defeat (1815–1848), when the Congress of Vienna restored the old order under Metternich, until the 1848 revolution. In Switzerland, eine Restauration is a restaurant. Restaurieren means to restore, and der Restaurator a restorer. Plural: die Restaurationen."
